overstort_herzien.ttl <pre><code>@prefix sosa:   &lt;http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/&gt; .
@prefix time:   &lt;http://www.w3.org/2006/time#&gt; .
@prefix geo:    &lt;http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#&gt; .
@prefix dct:    &lt;http://purl.org/dc/terms/&gt; .
@prefix adms:   &lt;http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#&gt; .
@prefix saref:  &lt;https://saref.etsi.org/core/&gt; .
@prefix xsd:    &lt;http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#&gt; .
@prefix rdfs:   &lt;http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#&gt; .

@prefix sensor:        &lt;https://aquafin.be/id/sensor/&gt; .
@prefix event:         &lt;https://aquafin.be/id/event/&gt; .
@prefix meetpunt:      &lt;https://aquafin.be/id/meetpunt/&gt; .
@prefix inzet:         &lt;https://aquafin.be/id/inzet/&gt; .
@prefix kenmerk:       &lt;https://aquafin.be/id/concept/Kenmerk/&gt; .
@prefix overstortstatus: &lt;https://aquafin.be/id/concept/OverstortStatus/&gt; .
